# YouTube OAuth Credentials
# Required: Google OAuth client ID
# Optional: client_secret (NOT needed with UWP client type and PKCE)
# 
# IMPORTANT: When creating OAuth client in Google Cloud Console:
# - Use "UWP" (Universal Windows Platform) client type, NOT "Desktop app"
# - The "Desktop app" type incorrectly requires client_secret even with PKCE (Google's quirk)
# - UWP type correctly supports PKCE-only flow without client_secret
# 
# According to OAuth 2.0 best practices and PKCE specification:
# - Desktop apps are public clients and should NOT store secrets
# - PKCE eliminates the need for client_secret
# 
# Get these from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com
# YOUTUBE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-your-client-secret-here  # NOT NEEDED with UWP client type

# Discogs OAuth Credentials
# Required: Discogs API consumer key and secret
# Get these from: https://www.discogs.com/settings/developers
DISCOGS_CONSUMER_KEY=your-consumer-key-here
DISCOGS_CONSUMER_SECRET=your-consumer-secret-here
